Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.70,0:00:03.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.61,0:00:06.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.99,0:00:08.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freaking witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.79,0:00:11.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道怎么关闭地狱之门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured out how to close the gates of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.48,0:00:14.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝建立了一系列测试  等你都完成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God built a series of tests, and when you've done all three,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.01,0:00:15.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就可以去关门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can slam the gates. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.64,0:00:16.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  第一项是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Where do we start?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.43,0:00:20.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得杀一只地狱之犬并浸于它的血中\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to kill a hound of hell and bathe in its blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.09,0:00:21.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要你安安全全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:23.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我要去做这些测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm gonna do these trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.61,0:00:29.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  我没能通过测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I didn't pass the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.69,0:00:31.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我通过了  剩下的都让我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I did, and I'm doing the rest of them. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.35,0:00:31.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想得美\N{\fnArial\fs30}My ass you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.50,0:00:34.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.32,0:00:37.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.70,0:00:40.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(密苏里州  圣路易斯)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.07,0:00:45.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚真不赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was great, 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.84,0:00:51.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想给你点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I want to give you a little something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:56.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿着  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.36,0:00:57.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-谢谢你  -嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.75,0:01:39.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来我今晚不走运啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess it's not my night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.36,0:01:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.73,0:02:49.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.11,0:02:54.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第8季第15集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.89,0:03:04.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.77,0:03:16.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说过的所有的傻话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, of all the lame-ass things you've ever said,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.24,0:03:17.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这绝对是最傻的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's got to be the lame-assiest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.75,0:03:19.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  但我就是觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, but I happen to think
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.72,0:03:22.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.72,0:03:22.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夏普比科里(美国20世纪早期的喜剧演员)更搞笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shemp was a funnier stooge than Curly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.12,0:03:23.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,科里是个天才啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curly was a freaking genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.48,0:03:25.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我总觉得科里的笑点太明显了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always found Curly's work a bit obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.56,0:03:28.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来就是要明显啊  他们是臭皮匠\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's supposed to be obvious, man. They're stooges.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.03,0:03:31.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们今晚给詹姆斯打电话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we calling James tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.68,0:03:33.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天再打吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'll just call him tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.69,0:03:34.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一路真辛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That drive was a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.76,0:03:37.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道他什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder what he wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.58,0:03:39.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他短信里说需要我们帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, his text said that he needed help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.95,0:03:41.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是个警察  应该是跟工作有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a cop. I figured it was work-related.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.93,0:03:43.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的确欠他一个人情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, we do owe him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.97,0:03:47.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他救过我们一次  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy saved our lives once, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.37,0:03:49.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他又不是...  -救过我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I mean, it's not like the guy - - Saved our lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.19,0:03:53.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去买啤酒  你要什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go for a beer run. You need anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.74,0:03:54.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.52,0:03:57.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.21,0:03:58.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.61,0:04:01.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你刚刚宰了一头地狱之犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you did just gank a hellhound,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.94,0:04:04.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可不是件小事\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is no slice of pie,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.51,0:04:08.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不知道后面有什么事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, uh, there is a mine field of who knows what crap ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.82,0:04:11.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想确保你真的没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just want to make sure that you are okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.28,0:04:15.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.90,0:04:18.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以再找一条地狱之犬来\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause, you know, we could find another devil dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.03,0:04:19.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别插手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could tag out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.43,0:04:20.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去宰了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could snuff the son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.02,0:04:25.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  凯文都不知道下一项测试是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, Kevin doesn't even know what the next trial is yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.73,0:04:29.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管你在担心什么  别担心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So whatever it is you're worried about, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.29,0:04:31.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会准备好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.72,0:05:21.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你乖吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. You friendly?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.90,0:05:24.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真乖  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friendly. Good. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.31,0:05:26.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可真漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a pretty dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.87,0:05:28.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.34,0:05:30.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要我挠挠你的肚皮吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want, uh -- you want a little belly scratch, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.41,0:05:33.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, who do you belong to?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.71,0:05:37.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  没有狗牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. No tags.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.82,0:05:40.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么跑到这儿来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.57,0:05:45.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.77,0:05:53.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.09,0:05:55.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你先别发火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before you get pissed off, look,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.33,0:05:57.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得告诉你这不是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I just want you to know this isn't my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.14,0:05:59.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她自己跑来挠门的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She just showed up at the door, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.32,0:06:02.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也没踩泥巴进来  只是想让我挠挠她肚子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't track in any mud. Just wanted her belly scratched.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.99,0:06:05.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得或许可以留她一晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I figured maybe she could stay tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.81,0:06:07.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天给她找个家\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'd try and find her a home tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.15,0:06:19.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她可以留一晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can stay the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.37,0:06:25.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两秒之前她还是条狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two seconds ago, she was a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.70,0:06:28.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.47,0:06:31.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是变形怪  把刀收起来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a shapeshifter, so you can stash the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.85,0:06:34.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是灵兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.25,0:06:35.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}A what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.19,0:06:39.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巫师的伴侣  有些巫师有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Companion to a witch -- some witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.89,0:06:42.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在人和动物之间来回变身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Split their time between human and animal form.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.50,0:06:46.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我另一种形态时能更准确地判断一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get a more accurate read on people in my other persona.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.72,0:06:48.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样在汽车酒店接近一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Approaching guys in a motel room like this --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.80,0:06:50.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能会变得很复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, it gets complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.52,0:06:54.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫波西亚  我是詹姆斯·弗兰普顿的灵兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name's Portia. I belong to James Frampton.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.06,0:06:57.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.74,0:06:59.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, that -- that doesn't work for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.37,0:07:02.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么说的话  詹姆斯不就是巫师了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause that would mean that our buddy James is a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.18,0:07:05.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真灵光啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. You're quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.30,0:07:07.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯是巫师吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}James is a freaking witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.78,0:07:09.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们相遇的时候他不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wasn't when you met him,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.23,0:07:11.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你们上次跟他合作的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that last case you worked on with him --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.10,0:07:12.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,疯狂的炼金术士  相当麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, lunatic alchemist. It was nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.50,0:07:16.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯想近一步了解那些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}James wanted to learn more about that world --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.12,0:07:18.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖术  魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}The black arts, witchcraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.23,0:07:20.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变成了他生活的重心\N{\fnArial\fs30}It became the center of his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.86,0:07:22.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, so you're telling me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.03,0:07:26.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯因为我们从警察变成了巫师吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that James the cop became a witch because of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.93,0:07:31.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是爱狗之人  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't like dogs, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.19,0:07:35.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  詹姆斯不做警察了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. So James isn't a cop anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.38,0:07:37.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.31,0:07:38.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凶案组警探\N{\fnArial\fs30}Homicide detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.96,0:07:40.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的法力让他查案更厉害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His new powers make his work even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.12,0:07:42.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那他找我们什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what does he need from us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.39,0:07:44.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他出了点事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, something's been happening to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.43,0:07:47.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起先是头疼欲裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It started with excruciating headaches,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.78,0:07:51.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耳际有尖叫声  可怕的噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}screaming sounds in his ears, horrible nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.71,0:07:54.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能睡觉也不能思考  他无法工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unable to sleep or think. He can't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.05,0:07:57.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像是精神崩溃\N{\fnArial\fs30}It -- it's like he's having a breakdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.08,0:08:00.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许你们能帮他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you can find a way to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.82,0:08:05.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.40,0:08:09.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不怎么喜欢巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, witches -- not real fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.76,0:08:12.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.36,0:08:15.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯是个功勋卓著的警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, James is a cop with a spotless record.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.56,0:08:17.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他只用法力做好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's used his skills for nothing but good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.51,0:08:19.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你能不能暂时放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why don't you lose the ignorant bigotry
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.68,0:08:22.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你无知的偏见  给他个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}for maybe two seconds and give him a shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.41,0:08:29.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真性感啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was incredibly hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.01,0:08:34.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这话我不否认\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was pretty hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.47,0:09:12.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还是悠着点吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might want to go easy on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.56,0:09:17.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐  你气色好差\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, you look awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.01,0:09:20.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没好转吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not getting any better?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.38,0:09:22.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.73,0:09:25.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道我是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what's happening to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.23,0:09:29.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些噩梦  就像\N{\fnArial\fs30}These dreams they're like, um --
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.16,0:09:31.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}like torture.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.51,0:09:33.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没说噩梦的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't mention dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.61,0:09:38.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑暗  血腥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dark, bloody.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.99,0:09:41.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯宾塞  这些噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spencer, they, uh --
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.69,0:09:45.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真要吓死我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they scare the hell out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.23,0:09:47.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉那么真实\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're so real.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.95,0:09:49.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夜复一夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just night after night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.75,0:09:51.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够了  詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough, James.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.53,0:09:52.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得去找人帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to see someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.97,0:09:55.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.54,0:09:59.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能去找谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do we see?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.84,0:10:03.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这东西又没得治\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no medicine for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.46,0:10:08.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许你只是需要歇歇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you just need time away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.71,0:10:12.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's way beyond that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.60,0:10:15.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯  你承受不住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, it's too much -- 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.11,0:10:17.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做了那么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}all that you've taken on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.05,0:10:21.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不只是干得多的问题  还有工作本身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just the workload, but the nature of the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.51,0:10:23.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看看周围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.37,0:10:26.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这儿还有第二个警察吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}See a lot of cops, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.34,0:10:31.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样的生活是边缘的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life in this realm is life on the fringe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.59,0:10:32.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不于周围融合\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.80,0:10:40.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要怎么调解你自身和你的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you reconcile what you are with what you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.54,0:10:45.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道波西亚去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know where Portia is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.27,0:10:47.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.31,0:10:50.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.92,0:10:54.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我把她推开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm pushing her away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.51,0:11:01.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯做的梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, these dreams James is having --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.08,0:11:01.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他觉得都是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}he thinks that they're real?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.81,0:11:03.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他觉得他是真杀人了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thinks that he is actually killing people?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.93,0:11:05.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.26,0:11:09.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少他开始屏蔽我之前  我听到了这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least that's what I picked up before he started blocking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.59,0:11:11.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么叫屏蔽\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean, blocking you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.24,0:11:13.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灵兽和主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Familiars and their masters --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.47,0:11:15.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有心灵感应\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can communicate telepathically.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.92,0:11:18.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以随时进入詹姆斯的脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can get inside of James' head anytime I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.46,0:11:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他屏蔽了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he shut me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.32,0:11:22.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你是觉得他脑海里有他不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, you think maybe there's something in there
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.69,0:11:23.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看到的东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}he doesn't want you to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.98,0:11:25.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possibly, yeah --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.55,0:11:28.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是某种黑暗的  对他不利的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something dark, you know, that's destroying him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.44,0:11:32.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不能去报警  又不信任其他巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't go to the police, and he doesn't trust other witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.43,0:11:33.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他信任我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he trusts us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.11,0:11:36.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我们是谁吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do know who we are, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.72,0:11:38.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是詹姆斯这种人最不该\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the last people that somebody like James
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.40,0:11:40.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倾诉的对象\N{\fnArial\fs30}needs to be telling his troubles to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.20,0:11:42.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was my idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.87,0:11:45.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我以詹姆斯的名义发了短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was the one who sent you the text under James' name.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.60,0:11:46.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不知道你们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't know you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.79,0:11:50.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但  我觉得你们可能是他唯一的希望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...I think you're maybe all he has.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.09,0:12:15.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.23,0:12:27.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你无权这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've no right to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.89,0:12:29.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我担心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was afraid for your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.80,0:12:32.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么样与他们无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}My life is none of their business!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.10,0:12:48.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.22,0:12:51.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然搞上巫术了  詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witchcraft, James? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.63,0:12:53.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么想的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.45,0:12:55.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是来帮我还是骂我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come to help or pile on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.76,0:12:57.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想说  掺和那东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying, you screw with that stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.43,0:12:58.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会发疯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna fry your wiring.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.82,0:13:00.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.10,0:13:03.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我们说说这些梦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, why don't you tell us about these dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.68,0:13:06.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说梦里有人丧命\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said people were dying in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.90,0:13:08.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丧命\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dying"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.32,0:13:10.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是被撕碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were torn to bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.10,0:13:15.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能感觉到自己的手抓裂他们的肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh, I could feel my fingers ripping into their flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.41,0:13:16.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但的确是梦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they were dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.49,0:13:19.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我醒来时在床上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I, uh, woke up in my bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.98,0:13:23.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是梦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so...dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.28,0:13:24.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.70,0:13:27.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些都没用  詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not helping, James.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.49,0:13:30.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人  他们死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those people -- they died.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.78,0:13:32.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟分局核实过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I checked with the precinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.45,0:13:37.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  或许你是听说了这些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, maybe you heard it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.26,0:13:38.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就记在了心里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it stuck in your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.48,0:13:41.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我自己没这么想过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're -- you don't think I-I told myself all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.39,0:13:44.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我没对自己说  "那不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think I didn't say, "That wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.03,0:13:46.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会做那种事"吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't have done such a thing"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.64,0:13:54.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是你的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.35,0:14:00.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯·马丁·弗兰普顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}James Martin Frampton.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.77,0:14:08.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.45,0:14:09.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会不会是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.26,0:14:13.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你惹怒了其他巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, you pissed off another witch,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.33,0:14:17.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他或她给你下了咒  逼你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he or she hexed you and forced you to...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.79,0:14:20.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有这可能  但我没听过这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's possible, I suppose, but I never heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.31,0:14:23.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做过多少这样的梦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many of these dreams have you had?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.32,0:14:24.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.23,0:14:26.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后一次是昨晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}The most recent one is last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.87,0:14:29.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我袭击了一个盲人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, it was a blind man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.14,0:14:31.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.43,0:14:34.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我掐着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was choking him, and, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.28,0:14:37.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, James, we're gonna --
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.97,0:14:39.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会帮你想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna help you figure this out,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.24,0:14:40.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你自己也得做你该做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you're gonna have to do your part.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.18,0:14:43.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.59,0:14:54.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得留在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.04,0:15:00.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,软禁在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}House arrest, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.62,0:15:05.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后一个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got the last of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.66,0:15:08.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  我在看犯罪现场的报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Well, I have been looking at the crime-scene reports,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.52,0:15:12.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都跟詹姆斯跟我们说的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they are exactly the same as James told us --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.30,0:15:14.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被害人  日期和地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vics, dates, location.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.49,0:15:17.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后一个是个盲人  跟他说的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The most recent one was a blind man, just like he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.82,0:15:18.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.70,0:15:22.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还查了他警队的记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also, I looked into his record on the force.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.31,0:15:25.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他差不多是一夜从菜鸟警探变成了副队\N{\fnArial\fs30}He went from rookie detective to lieutenant basically overnight,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.88,0:15:27.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且过去四年\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in the last four years,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.04,0:15:30.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的破案率是百分之百\N{\fnArial\fs30}his solve rate's been right at about 100%.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.82,0:15:31.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.69,0:15:33.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他有"神助"嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got the booga-booga on his side.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.58,0:15:37.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们从没真正见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, you know that we've never actually seen
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.47,0:15:41.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比这个杀巫师的咒语施效吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}this witch-killing spell of Bobby's work, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.17,0:15:43.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这东西说不准啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, this is not a sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.85,0:15:47.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事说得准过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anything we ever do a sure thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.09,0:15:48.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  但我只是希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, no, but I would just like to 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.74,0:15:52.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽可能有点胜算\N{\fnArial\fs30}have the odds in our favor as much as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.53,0:15:55.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.21,0:16:00.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.79,0:16:05.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,担心  杀巫师咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Concerned about the, uh -- the witch-killing spell...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.76,0:16:08.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是我会搞砸这几项测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}...or that I'm gonna mess these trials up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.44,0:16:14.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们继续做下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we get too far down the road with this,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.52,0:16:16.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就不能回头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can't go back,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.74,0:16:20.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想替你也晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it'll be too late for me to jump in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.56,0:16:22.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁说就一定会那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who says that you're gonna have to?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.38,0:16:25.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定我这次真能做到呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, maybe I'll actually pull this one off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.65,0:16:26.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.36,0:16:28.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你想说什么  迪恩  你说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you're saying, Dean. You've said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.87,0:16:33.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直反复地想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I've been going over this and over this,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.88,0:16:37.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问自己你为什么就不信任我\N{\fnArial\fs30}asking myself "Why doesn't he trust me?"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.20,0:16:39.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最终我终于想通了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it occurred to me, finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.71,0:16:41.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是不信任我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not that you don't trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.35,0:16:44.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是你只信任自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's that you can only trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.28,0:16:48.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说完了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.10,0:16:49.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说完了我就不说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm done if you're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.09,0:16:56.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等我把咒语准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, once I get this put together, 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.26,0:16:59.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就不能犹豫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can't hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.40,0:17:00.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,需要用的时候  就得用\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we got to use it, we use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.61,0:17:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是指我们找到害詹姆斯的那个巫师时吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean if we find the witch that's doing this to James?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.58,0:17:06.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者如果就是他本人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or if there is no other witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.14,0:17:11.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者  我们不是第一次放走人了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or it wouldn't be the first free pass we've given, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.33,0:17:15.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我也喜欢詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I like James as much as the next guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.17,0:17:17.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是现在在死人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}but people are getting ganked here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.97,0:17:19.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且  本尼  凯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, Benny, Kate --
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.81,0:17:21.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们的命运不是自己选的\N{\fnArial\fs30}they were forced to be what they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.36,0:17:23.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而詹姆斯是自己选了这条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}James chose this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.74,0:17:28.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被害人都死得很惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vics were all torn up pretty bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.52,0:17:30.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像有人赤手撕碎了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like someone shredded them with their bare hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.13,0:17:34.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这怎么可能呢  艾德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like that could happen. Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.97,0:17:37.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾德·斯托尔兹  他在查这个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed Stoltz. He's lead on the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.05,0:17:38.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是基思特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Special agent Keith.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.02,0:17:40.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔什说你们的线索不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Josh here tells me you don't have a lot to go on. 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.92,0:17:42.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  作案地点分散\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Isolated parts of the city,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.70,0:17:45.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被害人都没什么亲友\N{\fnArial\fs30}vics who meant nothing to nobody, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.09,0:17:45.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.73,0:17:47.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和我的搭档看过了犯罪现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh, my partner and I had a look at the crime scenes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.79,0:17:50.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,局里的脚步还真慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things really must be slow at the bureau.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.65,0:17:53.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现场我们都查过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locations have already been knocked down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.40,0:17:56.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们找到了这块织物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we did manage to find this piece of fabric.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.74,0:17:59.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有遗漏也是难免的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things get overlooked. It happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.27,0:18:02.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你查下血好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you run the blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.49,0:18:04.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是被害人或者凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could be the vic. It could be the doers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.34,0:18:05.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看能不能找到匹配\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see if we get a match.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.52,0:18:09.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确实有个目击者称见到一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}A witness did mention seeing a man in a suit
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.82,0:18:11.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿白衬衫和西装的人离开现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a white shirt leaving the area, so --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.77,0:18:13.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在报告中没提及目击者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't mention a witness in your report.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.84,0:18:14.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有别的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.14,0:18:17.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.27,0:18:20.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回头告诉你分析结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get back to you on the lab work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.04,0:18:21.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-如果没别的事  -这个目击者\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So if that's all - - Sure, but this witness --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.65,0:18:24.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他没说别的了  基思特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all that was said, agent Keith.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.61,0:18:26.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们线索真的不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}We really don't have a lot here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.42,0:18:28.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.19,0:18:46.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都是在瞪我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I getting the stink eye in here or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.84,0:18:48.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们看得出你是外人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can tell you're an outsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.58,0:18:50.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这都是巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they all witches?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.00,0:18:52.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.73,0:18:55.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如果有什么跟詹姆斯相关的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if there's information out here about James,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.64,0:18:56.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们肯定知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'll know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.49,0:19:00.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯怎么找到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did James find you, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.15,0:19:02.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是那样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the way it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.77,0:19:07.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是灵兽找到主人  然后与他形影不离\N{\fnArial\fs30}The familiar finds the master, and they become inseparable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.18,0:19:09.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很多人对宠物也是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess a lot of people feel that way about their pets.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.94,0:19:11.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.80,0:19:14.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是詹姆斯的宠物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not James' pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.08,0:19:17.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并不总是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.61,0:19:19.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从来不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.15,0:19:23.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,主人和灵兽之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}The master and the familiar --
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.13,0:19:26.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有着牢不可破的联系  就像灵魂的融合\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's an unbreakable bond, like a melding of souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.18,0:19:28.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们愿意为对方献出生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}We would die for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.37,0:19:30.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,波西亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Portia.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.31,0:19:33.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.00,0:19:39.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  这位是菲利普·勒沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, Meet Phillippe LeChat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.42,0:19:42.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩是底特律来的巫士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean's a wiccan from Detroit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.05,0:19:44.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.43,0:19:47.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...sit, sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.26,0:19:50.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯宾塞在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spencer here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.66,0:19:51.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在哪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.73,0:19:58.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真奇怪  周围有猫我才这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's weird. That only happens around cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.44,0:20:00.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我说说詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about James.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.20,0:20:03.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面很多传言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lot of buzz out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.78,0:20:04.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是流言蜚语\N{\fnArial\fs30}All gossip.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.04,0:20:08.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,群落对他好像不太友好\N{\fnArial\fs30}The community has a little attitude going.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.03,0:20:11.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他活该\N{\fnArial\fs30}He brings it on himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.22,0:20:16.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当警察  巫师警察  他疯了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole cop thing -- witch cop -- is he nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.55,0:20:18.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said the exact same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.80,0:20:21.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有你  宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then there's you, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.22,0:20:25.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事没完  波西亚  你心里清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't done, Portia, and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.63,0:20:31.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  提点一下我  什么没完\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Uh, remind me, what -- what isn't done?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.30,0:20:32.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,波西亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Portia.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.36,0:20:38.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是个巫士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I'm a -- I'm a wiccan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.16,0:20:39.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来自底特律\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm from Detroit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.00,0:20:42.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问斯宾塞吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spencer's the man to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.58,0:20:44.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.93,0:20:48.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道有没有咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh... you ever heard of a-a spell
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.25,0:20:51.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以让一个巫师控制其他巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}where a witch can control the actions of another witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.18,0:20:56.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  从没听说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I never heard of a thing like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.69,0:20:58.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think it's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.74,0:21:01.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's James?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.28,0:21:05.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好多了  我会转达你的关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better. I'll tell him you asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.59,0:21:08.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,菲利普  该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Philippe, it's time we were going.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.86,0:21:09.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.14,0:21:12.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.43,0:21:16.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.67,0:21:32.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.66,0:21:37.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,失陪一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.71,0:21:39.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.58,0:21:40.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.63,0:21:41.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巫师酒吧  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some witch bar. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.91,0:21:45.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯衬衫上的血液检测报告出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I just got the lab work back from the blood on James' shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.29,0:21:46.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-怎么样  -不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And? - Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.90,0:21:49.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和三号死者的血液匹配\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood's an exact match to victim number three.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.68,0:21:52.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那结果不言自明了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that pretty much says it all, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.55,0:21:53.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.17,0:22:06.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真不想这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate doing this to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.98,0:22:13.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的  真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.61,0:22:15.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不必这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.22,0:22:17.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不会知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, they won't find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.45,0:22:20.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,波西亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Portia...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.86,0:22:23.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要是相信自己的清白\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I believe I'm innocent,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.31,0:22:25.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就得做正确的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to do the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.30,0:22:31.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是我有罪  就更得做正确的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I'm not innocent, I have to do the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.00,0:22:41.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我  总有一天这事会结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me one day this will be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.93,0:22:51.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.11,0:24:21.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.41,0:24:22.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.36,0:24:24.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们一定要听我说  不是詹姆斯干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to listen to me, please. It's not James.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.85,0:24:40.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚  我和詹姆斯很亲近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight, James and I were close,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.91,0:24:45.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有隔阂  十分亲密\N{\fnArial\fs30}without psychological walls -- intimate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.72,0:24:47.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't --
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.78,0:24:48.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们做爱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They had sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.86,0:24:56.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这...我还真没想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh -- I didn't expect that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.33,0:24:59.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的关系与众不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have an unusual relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.61,0:25:03.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灵兽不该和巫师上床的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Familiars aren't supposed to be sexually involved with their witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.97,0:25:07.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也可以理解  鉴于你是个...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understandable, you know, considering that you're a...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.22,0:25:10.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而他是个...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, and that he's...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.73,0:25:13.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's --
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.40,0:25:15.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮个忙吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little help here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.97,0:25:18.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不帮\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.06,0:25:21.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和詹姆斯已经好几周没做爱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}James and I -- we hadn't made love in weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.21,0:25:23.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他被痛苦吞没  将我关在了心门之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}His agony ate him up, and he shut me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.81,0:25:27.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是今晚  我看到了他的思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}But tonight, I saw his thoughts --
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.02,0:25:29.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对于凶杀的回忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Memories of the murders.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.91,0:25:32.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  你是要劝我们放过詹姆斯...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, is this you trying to talk us out of ganking James or --
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.77,0:25:35.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我看到的只有杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, that's all I saw -- just the kills.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.78,0:25:37.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有准备  没有思想过程\N{\fnArial\fs30}No preparation, no thought process,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.65,0:25:40.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有预谋  没有动机\N{\fnArial\fs30}no anticipation, no motive.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.08,0:25:41.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有毫无前因后果的杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the kills without context.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.95,0:25:43.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对凶案没有其它意识吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No other awareness of the crimes?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.44,0:25:44.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.64,0:25:50.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是不是至少说明了他是被人控制的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't that at least suggest he's under another's control?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.06,0:25:51.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯宾塞说那不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spencer said that wasn't possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.43,0:25:53.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说他从没听说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he'd never heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.80,0:25:56.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯已经被锁起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}James is chained.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.03,0:25:58.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被制服了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's confined.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.40,0:26:00.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少试一试吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least take a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.39,0:26:12.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.73,0:26:16.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还在调查这个小案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still investigating this crappy little case?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.51,0:26:19.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到联调局竟然这么闲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm awed the bureau has so much time on its hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.80,0:26:24.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在选择案件上可以自行做主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Well, we have some, uh, individual discretion to pursue cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.84,0:26:23.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.11,0:26:25.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回头找你  艾德\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll catch up later, Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.23,0:26:27.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  但是时间久了就会变成悬案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but at some point, cases like this go cold,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.50,0:26:28.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相信你也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}as I'm sure you're aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.93,0:26:31.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是没法查下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just not enough to keep them floating -- that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.13,0:26:33.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  没有新线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. No new leads, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.52,0:26:36.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  案子就要被搁置了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. And it's drifting towards the back burner, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.89,0:26:38.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没这么多人手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just don't have the manpower.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.17,0:26:39.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那失去弗兰普顿副队这样的人才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it must have been tough to lose a valuable resource
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.89,0:26:41.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是雪上加霜\N{\fnArial\fs30}like Lieutenant Frampton.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.03,0:26:45.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样  我和他...我们...\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, he and I -- we, uh --
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.78,0:26:47.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们从前一起办过案\N{\fnArial\fs30}We caught a case together a while back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.81,0:26:49.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有失去他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's not lost to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.94,0:26:51.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在休假\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's -- he's on leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.74,0:26:55.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记得他说自己是这里最年轻的副队\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember he said he was the youngest guy here to ever make lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.38,0:26:57.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定有几把刷子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must have made a few waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.83,0:27:01.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这地方就像狗拉雪橇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah. This place is run like a dogsled --
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.21,0:27:02.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人突出  只有咕哝\N{\fnArial\fs30}No stars. Just grunts.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.42,0:27:03.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一只狗疲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One mutt goes lame,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.25,0:27:06.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,另一只跳起来  奋力前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}another one pops up and slogs through the slush.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.79,0:27:07.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少陪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.22,0:27:38.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要见的这个法师\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this, uh, warlock we're meeting --
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.15,0:27:40.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是线人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's -- he's a snitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.41,0:27:42.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警察到处都有线人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cops have snitches all over town.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.00,0:27:46.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯怀疑群落里的人  就找德利西尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}James uses Drexyl when he suspects someone in the community.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.60,0:27:54.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得问问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.39,0:27:56.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,忍不住想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I can't help but wonder --
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.14,0:27:58.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狗和女孩  哪个为先\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which came first, dog or girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.59,0:28:00.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.94,0:28:02.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  我只是好奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I mean, I'm just curious
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.38,0:28:05.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为自己主要是哪一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}as to which one you consider yourself, mostly.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.87,0:28:07.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这跟我昨晚说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This have anything to do
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.77,0:28:10.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和詹姆斯的事有什么关系吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}with what I told you about James and me last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.97,0:28:13.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在想象那幅画面吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you're imagining it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.64,0:28:16.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.56,0:28:18.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  那是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.85,0:28:20.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.48,0:28:39.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,德利西尔  这位是迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drexyl, this is Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.18,0:28:41.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,底特律的巫士  有耳闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wiccan, Detroit. I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.95,0:28:43.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情况是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, here's the deal -- 
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.68,0:28:48.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,市井上没有巫师诅咒其他巫师的传闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}absolutely no word on the street about any witch hexing another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.04,0:28:50.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定没有这种咒语吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure there's not any kind of spell?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.09,0:28:53.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  底特律佬  我以消息可靠为傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Detroit, I pride myself on reliable sourcing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.44,0:28:57.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但关于詹姆斯的流言很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is, however, a lot of chatter about our James.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.48,0:28:58.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么样的流言\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of chatter?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.71,0:28:59.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他已经变成开膛手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That he's gone ripper.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.27,0:29:01.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像开膛手杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in Jack the...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.93,0:29:04.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人传言称他变成了一个杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's circulating the rumor that he's set at full kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.08,0:29:07.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人  我们的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Someone"? One of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.65,0:29:09.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果警察听到风声  逮捕詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the cops get wind of it, arrest James,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.49,0:29:13.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查出他的真实身份  我们就都暴露了\N{\fnArial\fs30}find out what he really is, that exposes the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.64,0:29:15.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道这绝对不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that can't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.07,0:29:16.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.98,0:29:18.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会给詹姆斯两个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna give James two choices...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.07,0:29:22.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离开或者切腹自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave or the full hara-kiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.55,0:29:24.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suicide?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.24,0:29:27.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巫师们赞赏这份高姿态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witches appreciate a grand gesture.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.25,0:29:28.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会让他那么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't let him do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.93,0:29:30.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那群落或许会代劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the community might do it for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.08,0:29:47.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在查看鲍比的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I have been going over Bobby's data.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.05,0:29:48.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.71,0:29:51.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,波西亚也许说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Portia might not be wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.41,0:29:53.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还真有一个咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out there is a spell for, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.65,0:29:56.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以把幻像植入另一个人的大脑中\N{\fnArial\fs30}for implanting images into another person's brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.14,0:29:57.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-真的吗  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.50,0:30:02.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将虚假的记忆植入另一个巫师脑中\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Creating false memories into another witch's mind."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.51,0:30:06.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那詹姆斯可能在完全无罪的情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}So James could be convinced he killed those other people
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.63,0:30:08.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被灌输了杀人的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}without ever touching them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.28,0:30:09.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那凶手或许真的另有其人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, then, maybe it is somebody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.72,0:30:12.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  而且还费尽心机陷害詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, who's going to a hell of a lot of trouble to make it look like James.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.05,0:30:13.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警方那边怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd the cops say?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.05,0:30:14.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.71,0:30:16.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾德·斯托尔兹说他们什么都没找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, according to Ed Stoltz, they got zip,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.96,0:30:17.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他们肯定有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they got something.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.81,0:30:20.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看见在调查此案的技术员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the, uh, tech guy who's working the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.35,0:30:23.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿着厚厚的标着"詹姆斯·弗兰普顿"的文件夹\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he had a huge file folder marked "James Frampton".
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.70,0:30:24.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这艾德没说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed didn't mention that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.96,0:30:26.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.20,0:30:28.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.39,0:30:31.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺便说一句  你值得表扬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, by the way, got to hand it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.24,0:30:33.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从波西亚说和詹姆斯那晚的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been 15 hours since Portia 
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.66,0:30:35.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到现在15小时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}mentioned her night with James,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.53,0:30:37.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还没有讲过一则人兽乱交的笑话\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not one bestiality joke out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.17,0:30:47.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,波西亚告诉我  我群落里的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Portia tells me my friends in the community
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.43,0:30:48.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想烧死我\N{\fnArial\fs30}wants me burned at the stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.12,0:30:51.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想说谎  事情越来越糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna lie. It's, uh...it's getting ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.90,0:30:54.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警方对查到的东西可能有所隐瞒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the cops may have more on the case than they're saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.19,0:30:55.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,包括一厚本关于你的档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}including a thick dossier on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.01,0:30:57.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-关于我  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Me? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.23,0:30:59.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉他们调查到的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get the feeling whatever they have 
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.07,0:31:02.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被锁在分局C110房间里\N{\fnArial\fs30}is under lock and key at the precinct, uh, room C-110.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.43,0:31:04.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们得想办法闯进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we need to break in.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.32,0:31:06.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.16,0:31:08.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整天一堆警察的楼里一间上锁的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}A locked room in a joint crawling with cops 24/7...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.62,0:31:09.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么就没想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't I think of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.90,0:31:14.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  巫师不用亲临也能到一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, a witch can go to a place without having to go to a place.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.69,0:31:17.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  像电话性爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, like phone sex?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.60,0:31:18.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灵魂出窍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Astral projection.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.93,0:31:21.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以将我的意识投射到任何地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can project my awareness anywhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.49,0:31:24.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这么躺着就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the comfort of right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.69,0:31:26.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但得解开锁链\N{\fnArial\fs30}But these have got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.07,0:31:28.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.52,0:31:29.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铐着铁链  就无法施展魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Irons on, no magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.77,0:31:31.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不施展魔法  就闯不进那房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}no magic, no break-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.33,0:31:34.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.42,0:31:37.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们必须和你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But only if we can go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.33,0:31:50.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯  你确定你还能做得到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, are you sure you're still even able to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.23,0:31:53.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可真让人信心倍增\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, that's a confidence builder.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.35,0:31:54.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我灵魂出窍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything else I should know
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.07,0:31:57.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把命交给他之前  还有什么要知道的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}before I become some disembodied thing, completely at his mercy?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.10,0:31:58.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭上眼睛吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.00,0:32:01.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管我看到什么  都会传给你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever I see, I'll pass on to you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.73,0:32:06.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.76,0:32:16.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(东圣路易斯警察局)
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.74,0:32:54.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(目击者证词)
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.00,0:33:00.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(菲利普·勒沙)
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.67,0:33:09.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯  怎么都不给点提示\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, why don't you give us a little warning
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.91,0:33:11.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样把我们拉回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna snap us back like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.21,0:33:14.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯托尔兹要立案起诉我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stoltz -- he's building a case against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.33,0:33:16.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.07,0:33:21.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾德  他总想要个大案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed -- he's always wanted a breakthrough case.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.96,0:33:25.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓一个犯事的警察  就够大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nailing a renegade cop -- that would qualify.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.55,0:33:28.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤其他对这个警察还怀恨在心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, especially one he holds a grudge against.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.61,0:33:30.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的第一个案子 \N{\fnArial\fs30}My first case 
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.19,0:33:33.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他因此没当上探长\N{\fnArial\fs30}they dropped him as lead detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.09,0:33:34.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我当上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They went with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.49,0:33:37.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那这算什么  是报复吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what is this, you think -- a payback?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.50,0:33:40.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不能逮捕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't just arrest you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.04,0:33:41.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他需要证词  需要证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs evidence. He needs proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.68,0:33:42.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他已经有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.40,0:33:44.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他什么都有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.82,0:33:45.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁的证词\N{\fnArial\fs30}From who?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.05,0:33:48.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,菲尔  那只猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phil. The cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.13,0:33:51.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,菲利普\N{\fnArial\fs30}Philippe.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.26,0:33:54.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey. Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.33,0:33:56.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯  好好说  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, hey. Talk this out, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.23,0:34:04.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯  别  我们一起解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, don't! We'll do this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.25,0:34:06.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  对你来说太危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we won't. It's not safe for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.92,0:34:08.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在一起的日子结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our time together is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.32,0:34:10.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,陪伴你是我的责任  我的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Standing by you is my duty, my choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.79,0:34:12.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,波西亚  我的天塌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Portia, the ceiling is coming down on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.88,0:34:14.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还有生路\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still have a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.02,0:34:15.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.59,0:34:17.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,波西亚  走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Portia, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.92,0:34:18.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}James 
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.99,0:34:20.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.35,0:34:31.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不觉得我戴牙套太晚了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you don't think it's too late for me to wear braces?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.37,0:34:32.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你都不会感觉到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't even notice them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.45,0:34:33.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会用隐形的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll put in transparent.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.36,0:34:43.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯  你干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.28,0:34:44.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要撒谎害我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you telling lies about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.99,0:34:46.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有  我不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not. I wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.55,0:34:48.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去了证据室\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the evidence room.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.03,0:34:51.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到了警方根据目击证人画的素描像\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the police sketch based on an eyewitness account.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.88,0:34:54.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.08,0:34:58.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了  不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.59,0:34:59.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me why.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.11,0:35:01.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.21,0:35:03.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.15,0:35:06.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的主人让我这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My master made me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.45,0:35:07.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.59,0:35:11.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是个懦夫和骗子  斯宾塞是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a coward and a liar. Spencer's my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.13,0:35:12.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直接命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}A direct command.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.43,0:35:16.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了  别伤了我的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, don't hurt my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.63,0:35:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没想...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not interested --
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.89,0:35:25.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他总那么没骨气\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was always spineless.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.20,0:35:29.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下是真的没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.53,0:35:42.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.11,0:35:46.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是幕后黑手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were behind all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.72,0:35:50.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我就虚心承认吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I humbly accept credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.09,0:35:54.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你让我觉得我是凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made me think I was a killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.74,0:36:00.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是艾德·斯托尔兹让你这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed Stoltz put you up to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.73,0:36:03.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他发现你是个巫师  想敲诈你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He found out you were a witch, tried to blackmail you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.26,0:36:07.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉米  你没有动脑思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not using your thinking cap, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.26,0:36:11.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实际上  他不相信神秘学这点很关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was actually crucial that he didn't believe in the occult.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.35,0:36:13.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的案子铁证如山呢  你说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say he's built quite a solid case, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.03,0:36:16.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.95,0:36:18.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你当然不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.84,0:36:20.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都没有考虑过我的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither of you ever considered my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.65,0:36:24.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,波西亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Portia?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.54,0:36:29.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是为了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.07,0:36:34.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能想象她选择了你  对我是多大的侮辱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you imagine the insult when she chose you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.84,0:36:38.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我第一次见她  就想让她作我的灵魂伴侣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted her as my soul mate the moment I saw her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.87,0:36:42.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她注定是我的灵兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was meant to be my familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.32,0:36:45.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她可不止是灵兽  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, she's way more than familiar, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.47,0:36:49.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她选你做主人  我忍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When she picked you as master, I endured it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.80,0:36:53.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你俩开始《暮色》之恋  违反了规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when you two went all Bella and Edward, broke the code,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.05,0:36:55.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将你们的激情放在群落规则之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}put your passions before the community rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.39,0:37:01.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你太自大  权利过剩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the arrogance, the entitlement was too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.13,0:37:04.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就应该被摧毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your total ruination seemed appropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.49,0:37:09.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,底特律来的巫士\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wiccan from Detroit.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.99,0:37:11.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那詹姆斯没杀死那些...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So James didn't kill those --
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.94,0:37:24.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真想跟我较量吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, you want to take me on?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.93,0:37:34.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.08,0:37:42.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不仅仅可以进入詹姆斯的脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not only James' head I can get inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.89,0:37:48.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.91,0:38:02.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.91,0:38:21.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.30,0:38:24.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.97,0:38:51.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子们  切勿在家模仿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, kids, don't try this at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.98,0:39:04.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真不想留下反击吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure you don't want to stay and fight this?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.37,0:39:06.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.04,0:39:08.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯宾塞说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh, Spencer was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.79,0:39:12.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾德·斯托尔兹证据确凿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed Stoltz has built enough of a case against me
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.65,0:39:15.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,足以折腾我好一阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}to make life hell for a long time,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.95,0:39:19.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里的群落也不想要我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the community here wants no part of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.45,0:39:22.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要重新开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}We start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.06,0:39:24.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,习惯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.58,0:39:28.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总是这样  你们也是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's always been, for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.82,0:39:32.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会想你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.61,0:39:36.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许也会想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe even you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.52,0:39:38.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.76,0:39:41.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你真的不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You really don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.58,0:40:10.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我之前可能错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's possible I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.72,0:40:13.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于詹姆斯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, about James?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.51,0:40:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  我们都打算去杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, we were both ready to gank the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.72,0:40:19.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我不是说这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.15,0:40:23.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之前  斯宾塞控制我们的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back there, when Spencer had us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.13,0:40:26.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他搅乱了我的头脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}He screwed with my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.34,0:40:28.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看见了妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.36,0:40:32.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她死的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}When she died...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.09,0:40:35.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有其他乱七八糟的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then some other crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.16,0:40:38.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.28,0:40:44.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我回想我们一家所经历的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, when I look back at what our family's been through,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.52,0:40:46.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每个人经历的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}what everybody's been through,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.07,0:40:50.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想到那些痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}seeing all that pain...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.53,0:40:54.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我意识到  我们能走到现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I realize that the only way we've made it through it all
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.47,0:40:55.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全靠彼此相依\N{\fnArial\fs30}is by hanging together.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.65,0:41:02.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小萨姆  我信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust you, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.61,0:41:05.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}With this deal, 
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.84,0:41:10.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把那些混蛋永远锁在熔炉里\N{\fnArial\fs30}locking those sons of bitches up in the furnace once and for all,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.27,0:41:11.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太重要了  我不能不信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's too important not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.38,0:41:16.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以如果你说你很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you say you're good...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.13,0:41:20.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}...then that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.36,0:41:21.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我百分之百支持你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with you 100%.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.01,0:41:30.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good.
